{"overview":"«آمار ان تمپوس ریوولتو» یک سریال صابونی اسپانیایی است که در دوران جنگ داخلی اسپانیا و اوایل فرانکویسم می‌گذرد؛ این سریال از سال ۲۰۰۵ پخش می‌شود و جوایزی در اسپانیا و مدال نقره در «جشنواره نیویورک» کسب کرده است؛ در ژانویه ۲۰۱۳ با نام جدید «آمار اس پارا سمپری» روی آنتنا ۳ پخش می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Amar en tiempos revueltos is a Spanish soap opera set in the times of the Spanish civil war and the early Francoism. The serial has been aired from 2005 and has won prizes in Spain and a Silver Medal in the «New York Festivals». In January 2013 will air on Antena 3 with new name, Amar es para siempre","tagline_en":"","runtime":60,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":1,"y":null,"poster":"/whLkiZh1BgWMAe8AIaesIbHoYJO.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":201,"y":2005,"poster":"/euj4c6Z17QE6uZz2UzcKlKU4kZ5.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":221,"y":2006,"poster":"/lmxmIQUF3MFNE1O7iDWgWoUiMAU.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":258,"y":2007,"poster":"/6trIyCMhGyvoQsE5SRIMqkkerwz.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":255,"y":2008,"poster":"/bNKkUSSqoAb1in0vr9cpEv3hTnw.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":256,"y":2009,"poster":"/qMGhKGemylAdlN6edwsKI1kodIp.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":261,"y":2010,"poster":"/kb8R3kAxGqSPDU33BR9jpaAE9xf.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":256,"y":2011,"poster":"/ahtDHkH6XvOA6IKhnW11su0jbXh.jpg"}],"episodes":1708,"crew":["Josep Maria Benet i Jornet","Antonio Onetti","Rodolf Sirera"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["ES"],"cast":[{"name":"Ana Otero","role":"Paloma Beltrán viuda de Maturino","photo":"/3pmab9inxPUamH3BRtPtn5HC9CR.jpg"},{"name":"Ana Turpin","role":"Andrea Robles Castillo de Ayala","photo":"/h204AWwYbztTt8AQxlJ3KrloLFE.jpg"},{"name":"Bárbara Santa-Cruz","role":"Aurelia González","photo":"/3d9MH5ZAfS8HHY4zSLL8y6XU4Du.jpg"},{"name":"Nadia de Santiago","role":"Asunción Muñoz Ruiz","photo":"/1ovFkRvABlQEfdnWVVmr7PqqTpI.jpg"},{"name":"Jorge Calvo","role":"Narciso Colmenar","photo":"/rvCVl2gukUqWJa1s0MapndM8cDt.jpg"},{"n